  displayName: Wendat
  leader: Kondiaronk
  date: c. 1690
  biography: Kondiaronk was a Tionontati-Wendat leader and diplomat. This c. 1690 depiction precedes his major role in the Great Peace of Montreal in 1701.
  region: Great Lakes region; Kondiaronk's community was associated with Michilimackinac.
  terrain:
  - Mixed Forest
  - Broadleaf Forest
  - Prairie
  goods:
  - Food
  - Fur
  jobs:
  - Farmers
  - Fur Trappers
  rival: Haudenosaunee
  scenarioAggression: Low
  contextNote: The faction uses the broad Wendat label with Kondiaronk's Tionontati background stated explicitly. Haudenosaunee is a historical scenario rival, not a permanent enemy.
  sources:
  - https://pacmusee.qc.ca/en/stories-of-montreal/article/kondiaronk-broker-of-the-great-peace-of-montreal/
